TEEWARS LEGACY
--------------
Description:
Teewars legacy - its online dead match game licensed under zlib license, where you control small tee on big maps to kill another tee's and get big score. You can download it and play indefinitely, and this game fully FREE.
--------------
Features:
* 2 Excellent map
* Clear looking graphics
This project is currently in early development (INDEV)
Controls:
A or arrow left - Move left
D or arrow right - Move right
Space or W - Jump
Left click - Shoot
Right click - Hook
* 
